<title>USA: UKRAINE SIGNS $10 MLN PL-480 PACT FOR U.S. COTTON.</title>
<headline>UKRAINE SIGNS $10 MLN PL-480 PACT FOR U.S. COTTON.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department said Thursday that Ukraine had signed a PL-480 agreement to provide for the sale of $10 million in U.S. cotton.</p>
<p>The agreement would allow sale of about 26,000 bales of cotton at 480 lbs per bale during fiscal 1997, ending September 30.</p>
<p>Authorization for the sale would be issued later.</p>
</text>
